; FELL THE MIGHTY, the core active (ruling 12; the script's header has the reasoning). action_type 4 is
; Lancer.ACTION.PROTOCOL; consumes_cp spends the core power. apply_to_sensors: the target range is the
; Black Mountain's Sensors. apply_only_to_enemies: "a hostile character" (the archetype's can_target_unit
; adds is_actor). can_reapply TRUE so two Black Mountains stack (ruling 13 - see the script). Its own
; usage_group: the Kit also carries Exalt and the Efficient refund. SP3: its OWN glyph family (Fell the
; Mighty / DOOMED), which buff_doomed wears too.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_action")
buffs = Array[ExtResource("2_buff")]([ExtResource("3_doomed")])
apply_to_sensors = true
apply_only_to_enemies = true
can_reapply = true
action_type = 4
consumes_cp = true
usage_group = &"action_fell_the_mighty"
